<title>TANZANIA: SOCCER-TANZANIA AND NAMIBIA DRAW 0-0 IN COSAFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TANZANIA AND NAMIBIA DRAW 0-0 IN COSAFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MWANZA, Tanzania 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tanzania and Namibia</p>
<p>drew 0-0 in a Cosafa Castle Cup soccer match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p> Standings     P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p> Zambia	  1  1  0  0  4  0   3</p>
<p> Mozambique    1  0  1  0  2  2   1</p>
<p> Namibia	 1  0  1  0  1  1   1</p>
<p> Tanzania	1  0  1  0  1  1   1</p>
<p> Malawi	  2  0  1  1  2  6   1</p>
<p>Next match: June 15 - Mozambique v Tanzania.</p>
</text>
